// cardpair — the OLDER declaration of the retain pair (see newer.schema): the
// same table, before the three fields the newer declaration adds. Its retained
// load and save keep the unknown scalar and string, and drop the unknown
// *string (kind 17, the node-index class) as loss (docs/SPEC-TABLES.md §6.6).
package cards

table Card
{
    id    string(8)
    n     int32
}
